Package: pulsaros-feedback
Version: 1.0.5
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: pulsaros-branding
Description: Pulsar OS Feedback and System Logs Reporter
 Provides a clean and native application for Pulsar OS to submit feedback
 and system diagnostic logs (journalctl boot logs) directly formatted as a
 GitHub issue to the PKG repository.
